WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:18.343
"I saw all kinds of animals," Izzie said to Nina.

2
00:00:18.344 --> 00:00:22.216
"The frogs were great. I love frogs.

3
00:00:22.217 --> 00:00:24.630
But my favorite was the flamingo."

4
00:00:24.631 --> 00:00:28.710
Izzie had gone to the zoo on Saturday with her family.

5
00:00:28.711 --> 00:00:34.458
Now it was all she could talk about.

6
00:00:34.459 --> 00:00:37.350
Miss Shelly blew her whistle.

7
00:00:37.351 --> 00:00:40.837
"Girls! Time to start," she said.

8
00:00:40.838 --> 00:00:43.527
The kids gathered around the table.

9
00:00:43.528 --> 00:00:48.979
Miss Shelly was wearing a black mask with colorful sequins and feathers.

10
00:00:48.980 --> 00:00:54.035
"Wow. Why are you wearing that, Miss Shelly?" Izzie asked.

11
00:00:54.036 --> 00:00:59.218
"Because today we'll make masks—party masks, like this one.

12
00:00:59.219 --> 00:01:04.923
Or secret-agent masks or monster masks . . . ," Miss Shelly said.

13
00:01:04.924 --> 00:01:11.209
"Oh, I'm going to make a secret-agent mask," Bobby said.

14
00:01:11.210 --> 00:01:17.806
"Mine's going to be a super secret-agent mask," Jason said.

15
00:01:17.807 --> 00:01:21.878
"I'm going to make a party mask!" Nina said.

16
00:01:21.879 --> 00:01:23.868
"What about you, Izzie?

17
00:01:23.869 --> 00:01:26.676
Let's make party masks together!"

18
00:01:26.677 --> 00:01:31.770
Izzie thought for a moment. "Okay. I guess so."

19
00:01:31.771 --> 00:01:36.559
"Here is a plain mask for each of you," Miss Shelly said.

20
00:01:36.560 --> 00:01:39.656
"The rest of the decorations are on the table.

21
00:01:39.657 --> 00:01:42.357
You can use anything you like.

22
00:01:42.358 --> 00:01:49.264
Just glue the pieces to the front of the mask, the side that won't touch your face," Miss Shelly said.

23
00:01:49.265 --> 00:01:51.722
Izzie looked at the table.

24
00:01:51.723 --> 00:01:55.799
There were ribbons, fabric, buttons, and feathers.

25
00:01:55.800 --> 00:02:00.187
Izzie saw two pink feathers poking out of the pile.

26
00:02:00.188 --> 00:02:03.602
Suddenly she got a great idea.

27
00:02:03.603 --> 00:02:05.743
"Nina," she said.

28
00:02:05.744 --> 00:02:09.287
"I'm not going to make a party mask with you."

29
00:02:09.288 --> 00:02:12.178
"Why not?" Nina looked hurt.

30
00:02:12.179 --> 00:02:17.023
"Because I'm going to make a flamingo mask!" Izzie cried.

31
00:02:17.024 --> 00:02:19.302
"An animal mask.

32
00:02:19.303 --> 00:02:22.694
What a cool idea!" Miss Shelly said.

33
00:02:22.695 --> 00:02:25.092
Nina looked down at her mask.

34
00:02:25.093 --> 00:02:30.051
She had already begun to glue different-colored sequins to one corner.

35
00:02:30.052 --> 00:02:32.029
"Flamingos are pink.

36
00:02:32.030 --> 00:02:34.097
But their beaks are black and white.

37
00:02:34.098 --> 00:02:36.065
And they stick out too.

38
00:02:36.066 --> 00:02:37.378
I need to make a beak,"

39
00:02:37.379 --> 00:02:41.289
Izzie said, grabbing a handful of sequins.

40
00:02:41.290 --> 00:02:44.335
"Fine," Nina said, frowning.

41
00:02:44.336 --> 00:02:47.197
"But don't take all the sequins."

42
00:02:47.198 --> 00:02:50.502
Izzie folded a piece of cardboard into a beak.

43
00:02:50.503 --> 00:02:52.830
She glued it to her mask.

44
00:02:52.831 --> 00:02:56.446
Then she decorated the rest of the mask with pink feathers.

45
00:02:56.447 --> 00:03:04.606
Finally she covered the beak with black and white sequins.

46
00:03:04.607 --> 00:03:10.074
"Squawk, squawk." Izzie put on her mask and stood on one leg.

47
00:03:10.075 --> 00:03:12.682
"I'm a flamingo!"

48
00:03:12.683 --> 00:03:17.882
"And I'm a ladybug!" Nina put on her mask too.

49
00:03:17.883 --> 00:03:24.769
"I wanted to be an animal too," she said shyly.

50
00:03:24.770 --> 00:03:28.307
"Can you tell me where you were on the night of April 19th?"

51
00:03:28.308 --> 00:03:32.781
a boy in a gray mask and sunglasses suddenly asked.

52
00:03:32.782 --> 00:03:37.571
"Yes, and we'd like to know your real name, Miss Ladybug,"

53
00:03:37.572 --> 00:03:43.138
said another boy, in a blue mask and sunglasses.

54
00:03:43.139 --> 00:03:46.221
"Ah!" the girls shrieked.

55
00:03:46.222 --> 00:03:49.993
Miss Shelly laughed.

56
00:03:49.994 --> 00:03:53.148
"Great masks, boys," she said.

57
00:03:53.149 --> 00:03:55.466
She put on her mask too.

58
00:03:55.467 --> 00:03:58.693
"Now no one will recognize us!"

59
00:03:58.694 --> 00:04:02.467
The gym door opened, and Ms. Folani walked in.

60
00:04:02.468 --> 00:04:05.074
The principal looked confused.

61
00:04:05.075 --> 00:04:07.032
"Who are you?

62
00:04:07.033 --> 00:04:10.757
I thought the Kids Central kids were in here today."

63
00:04:10.758 --> 00:04:14.332
"Aliens kidnapped the Kids Central kids at the zoo.

64
00:04:14.333 --> 00:04:19.820
We secret agents are here to investigate," Jason said seriously.

65
00:04:19.821 --> 00:04:24.688
"The ladybug and the flamingo may be part of the crime," Bobby added.

66
00:04:24.689 --> 00:04:31.351
Nina and Izzie giggled behind their masks.

67
00:04:31.352 --> 00:04:34.174
"Oh!" Ms. Folani exclaimed.

68
00:04:34.175 --> 00:04:37.736
"Well, please let me know what you find out.

69
00:04:37.737 --> 00:04:48.055
Those kids from Kids Central are very important to us."
